#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/vcs_versioning.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of vcs_versioning"
msgstr "Instalação do vcs_versioning"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/vcs_versioning.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid "Build the module:"
msgstr "Construa o módulo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/vcs_versioning.xml:85
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/vcs_versioning.xml:88
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>&install-wheel; vcs_versioning</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>&install-wheel; vcs_versioning</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/vcs_versioning.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the installation, issue (<literal>HOME=</literal> prevents the "
"<filename>.gitconfig</filename> file in the home directory from interfering "
"the tests):"
msgstr ""
"Para testar a instalação, emita (<literal>HOME=</literal> impede que o "
"arquivo <filename>.gitconfig</filename> no diretório lar interfira nos "
"testes):"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/vcs_versioning.xml:96
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"testenv/bin/pip3 install pytest-timeout        &amp;&amp;\n"
"HOME= testenv/bin/python3 -m pytest</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"testenv/bin/pip3 install pytest-timeout        &amp;&amp;\n"
"HOME= testenv/bin/python3 -m pytest</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/vcs_versioning.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test suite may cause keyboard inputs not displayed on the screen at all "
"(but you can still run any command if you can type it correctly).  Run the "
"<command>reset</command> command to fix such an issue."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste possivelmente cause entradas do teclado não exibidas na "
"tela em absoluto (porém, você ainda consegue executar qualquer comando, se "
"conseguir digitá-lo corretamente). Execute o comando "
"<command>reset</command> para corrigir tal problema."

